    inv --> seed[Seed AAP from the laptop<br/>the last required laptop run]
    seed --> done([After seed: providers, maps, and waves<br/>run from AAP job templates])
    classDef laptop fill:#ffffff,stroke:#ee0000,stroke-width:1.5px;
    class deploy,seed laptop
